# sync-shared-wiki substitution map (EXAMPLE — replace the right-hand values).
#
# Copy this file to ~/.claude/shared-wiki/.sync-map and set each right-hand
# value to the real agent name you deploy. Keep it OUTSIDE the repo: real
# names are never committed, which is the whole reason the canonical pages
# ship with placeholders.
#
# Format: <placeholder>=<real-deployed-name>   (one per line; # starts a comment)
# Order does not matter — the sync applies longest placeholder first.

your-pr-reviewer=my-reviewer
your-pr-review-fetcher=my-review-fetcher
your-pr-review-scribe=my-review-scribe
your-cross-vendor-reviewer=my-second-vendor-reviewer
your-same-vendor-reviewer=my-same-vendor-reviewer
your-patch-drafter=my-patch-drafter
your-triage-agent=my-triage
your-triage-fetcher=my-triage-fetcher
your-triage-reporter=my-triage-reporter
your-triage-scribe=my-triage-scribe
